akerId":12689,"speakerName":"Pharez","textMapHash":1081168330,"text":"Ugh... Blargh... You... This was your handiwork! How are you vomiting too?","nextNodeIds":[230300503]},{"nodeId":230300503,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1112491674,"text":"Ugh... *cough* *cough* *cough*","nextNodeIds":[230300504]},{"nodeId":230300504,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12688,"speakerName":"Ladep","textMapHash":4285284114,"text":"I have... explained multiple times that I added physiological emetics!","nextNodeIds":[230300505]},{"nodeId":230300505,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12688,"speakerName":"Ladep","textMapHash":1696133810,"text":"It has nothing to do with whether you are used to it. The smell just triggers automatic vomiting in anyone.","nextNodeIds":[230300506]},{"nodeId":230300506,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12688,"speakerName":"Ladep","textMapHash":1134739450,"text":"Seriously, why do I even repeat myself? You won't understand anyway... Blergh...","nextNodeIds":[230300507]},{"nodeId":230300507,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4178,"speakerName":"Yasmin","textMapHash":2441642578,"text":"Eh? Ladep, Pharez, and the Traveler, too? What brings all of you here?","nextNodeIds":[230300508]},{"nodeId":230300508,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4178,"speakerName":"Yasmin","textMapHash":1763964138,"text":"And the potion jar is broken... Was there some kind of monster attack?","nextNodeIds":[230300509]},{"nodeId":230300509,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12688,"speakerName":"Ladep","textMapHash":1135796810,"text":"Judging from how things look... That's probably the case. Did you see any monsters on your way here?","nextNodeIds":[230300510]},{"nodeId":230300510,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4178,"speakerName":"Yasmin","textMapHash":4079678690,"text":"No. In fact, I even took some time to sample several plants around here.","nextNodeIds":[230300511]},{"nodeId":230300511,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12688,"speakerName":"Ladep","textMapHash":4110984002,"text":"That's quite odd... Very odd indeed.","nextNodeIds":[230300512]},{"nodeId":230300512,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12689,"speakerName":"Pharez","textMapHash":2028136154,"text":"What's so odd about this? Your potion is what attracted them here, obviously!","nextNodeIds":[230300513]},{"nodeId":230300513,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12688,"speakerName":"Ladep","textMapHash":1525295482,"text":"What!? The field tests didn't demonstrate anything like that...","nextNodeIds":[230300514]},{"nodeId":230300514,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12689,"speakerName":"Pharez","textMapHash":1637566986,"text":"Well, now you've seen it with your own eyes, can you be a little more realistic?","nextNodeIds":[230300515]},{"nodeId":230300515,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12688,"speakerName":"Ladep","textMapHash":3543224402,"text":"We will... discuss that later. Traveler, thanks so much for your help. Please take this as your payment.","nextNodeIds":[230300516]},{"nodeId":230300516,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12688,"speakerName":"Ladep","textMapHash":369183170,"text":"Where did it go wrong...","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2303005,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["133302153","0"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_UNREGISTER_DYNAMIC_GROUP"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["42040","0"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_INC_DAILY_TASK_VAR"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["42040"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_NOTIFY_DAILY_TASK"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_POINT","LNHLPKELCAL":["Q23030